{
  "info": {
    "name": "BTNG Showroom & Rental Mobil API",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman untuk REST API Showroom & Rental Mobil (Laravel 12 + MySQL + Sanctum + Scramble).\n\n## Cara pakai\n\n1. Buka **Variables** koleksi ini, ubah `baseUrl` bila perlu.\n   - Lokal: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`\n   - Produksi: `https://<app-anda>.cleverapps.io`\n2. Jalankan folder **Auth** → request **Login**. Token tersimpan otomatis ke variabel `token`.\n3. Jalankan folder **Mobil** / **Pelanggan** → request **Create**. ID hasil simpan tersimpan otomatis ke `mobilId` / `pelangganId`.\n4. Jalankan folder **Penyewaan** → request **Create**. ID tersimpan ke `penyewaanId`.\n\n## Dokumentasi\n\n- Scramble UI: `{{baseUrl}}/docs/api`\n- OpenAPI JSON: `{{baseUrl}}/docs/api.json`\n\n## Akun demo (dari seeder)\n\n- Email: `admin@showroom.test`\n- Password: `password123`\n\nSeluruh respons memakai amplop `{ \"message\": ..., \"data\": ... }`. Koleksi terpaginasi menambahkan `meta` dan `links`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "mobilId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "pelangganId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "penyewaanId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tanggalMulai",
      "value": "2026-12-01",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tanggalSelesai",
      "value": "2026-12-04",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Status code bukan 5xx', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.below(500);",
          "});",
          "",
          "pm.test('Respons memakai amplop message + data', function () {",
          "    var body = pm.response.json();",
          "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('message');",
          "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('data');",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Cek kesiapan API.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cek status API",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Mengembalikan `status`, `versi`, dan `waktu` server. Berguna untuk memastikan deployment hidup."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('status = ok', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Registrasi, login, profil, dan logout. Token Bearer disimpan otomatis ke variabel `token`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Operator Showroom\",\n    \"email\": \"operator@showroom.test\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Membuat akun baru dan langsung menerbitkan token. Status sukses: **201 Created**."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@showroom.test\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login dengan akun seeder. Token disimpan otomatis ke variabel koleksi `token`, sehingga request lain yang memakai auth Bearer langsung jalan."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Token diterbitkan', function () {",
                  "    var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('token');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token tersimpan ke variabel koleksi.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Profil saya",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Butuh header `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` (sudah diwarisi dari auth koleksi)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Berisi email pengguna', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.have.property('email');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Mencabut token yang sedang dipakai. Setelah ini variabel `token` perlu diisi ulang lewat Login."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobil",
      "description": "CRUD unit mobil + upload foto. Filter: `search`, `brand`, `status`, `transmisi`, `bahan_bakar`, `tahun`, `min_harga`, `max_harga`, `max_harga_sewa`, `sort_by`, `sort_dir`, `per_page`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Daftar mobil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobil?brand=Toyota&status=tersedia&sort_by=harga_sewa_harian&sort_dir=asc&per_page=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobil"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "brand",
                  "value": "Toyota",
                  "description": "Filter merk. Kosongkan untuk semua."
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "tersedia",
                  "description": "tersedia | disewa | servis | sold"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_by",
                  "value": "harga_sewa_harian",
                  "description": "nama | brand | harga | harga_sewa_harian | tahun | created_at"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_dir",
                  "value": "asc",
                  "description": "asc | desc"
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "1-100, default 10"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mengembalikan `message`, `data[]`, `meta` (pagination), dan `links`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('data berupa array', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('meta pagination lengkap', function () {",
                  "    var meta = pm.response.json().meta;",
                  "    pm.expect(meta).to.include.keys('current_page', 'per_page', 'total', 'last_page');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var pertama = pm.response.json().data[0];",
                  "if (pertama) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('mobilId', pertama.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Detail mobil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobil/{{mobilId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobil", "{{mobilId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Ambil satu unit berdasarkan ID. ID tidak ada → **404** dengan `data: null`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('id sesuai permintaan', function () {",
                  "    var id = parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('mobilId'), 10);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.id).to.eql(id);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Tambah mobil",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"plat_nomor\": \"B 1234 XYZ\",\n    \"nama\": \"Toyota Avanza 1.5 G CVT\",\n    \"brand\": \"Toyota\",\n    \"harga\": 275000000,\n    \"harga_sewa_harian\": 350000,\n    \"tahun\": 2024,\n    \"transmisi\": \"CVT\",\n    \"bahan_bakar\": \"Bensin\",\n    \"kapasitas_kursi\": 7,\n    \"foto\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549317661-bd32c8ce0db2?w=1200\",\n    \"deskripsi\": \"MPV keluarga, kabin lega, konsumsi BBM irit.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobil",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobil"]
            },
            "description": "Status sukses: **201 Created**. `status` tidak perlu dikirim, default `tersedia`. ID hasil simpan otomatis masuk ke variabel `mobilId`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('mobilId', body.data.id);",
                  "    pm.test('status default tersedia', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(body.data.status).to.eql('tersedia');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Perbarui mobil",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"harga_sewa_harian\": 375000,\n    \"status\": \"servis\",\n    \"deskripsi\": \"Sedang perawatan berkala di bengkel resmi.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobil/{{mobilId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobil", "{{mobilId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Boleh `PUT` (semua field) atau `PATCH` (sebagian field). Status sukses: **200 OK**."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('harga sewa ikut berubah', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.harga_sewa_harian).to.eql(375000);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload foto mobil",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "foto",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "File gambar: jpg, jpeg, png, atau webp. Maksimal 2 MB."
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobil/{{mobilId}}/foto",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobil", "{{mobilId}}", "foto"]
            },
            "description": "Kirim sebagai `multipart/form-data`. File disimpan di disk `public` dan URL-nya dikembalikan pada field `foto`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('field foto berisi URL', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.foto).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Hapus mobil",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobil/{{mobilId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobil", "{{mobilId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Status sukses **200 OK**. Bila unit masih punya riwayat penyewaan → **409 Conflict** (integritas foreign key)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 dihapus atau 409 masih punya riwayat', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([200, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Gagal validasi (422)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"plat_nomor\": \"\",\n    \"harga\": \"mahal\",\n    \"transmisi\": \"Otomatis\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobil",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobil"]
            },
            "description": "Contoh input anomali. Harus menghasilkan **422 Unprocessable Content** dengan `message`, `data: null`, dan `errors` per field."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('422 Unprocessable Content', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('errors memuat field yang salah', function () {",
                  "    var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('errors');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.errors).to.include.keys('plat_nomor', 'nama', 'harga');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('data null saat gagal', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.eql(null);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pelanggan",
      "description": "CRUD pelanggan. Filter: `search`, `email`, `sort_by`, `sort_dir`, `per_page`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Daftar pelanggan",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/pelanggan?per_page=10&sort_by=nama&sort_dir=asc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "pelanggan"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "1-100"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_by",
                  "value": "nama",
                  "description": "nama | email | created_at"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_dir",
                  "value": "asc",
                  "description": "asc | desc"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Tambahkan `?search=zain` untuk mencari pada nama, email, NIK, dan telepon."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var pertama = pm.response.json().data[0];",
                  "if (pertama) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('pelangganId', pertama.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Detail pelanggan",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/pelanggan/{{pelangganId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "pelanggan", "{{pelangganId}}"]
            },
            "description": "ID tidak ada → **404**."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Tambah pelanggan",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"nama\": \"Zain Yarfa Mubarok\",\n    \"nik\": \"3273010101010001\",\n    \"email\": \"zain@example.com\",\n    \"telepon\": \"081234567001\",\n    \"alamat\": \"Jl. Cihampelas No. 112, Bandung\",\n    \"nomor_sim\": \"SIM-327301010101\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/pelanggan",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "pelanggan"]
            },
            "description": "`nik` wajib 16 digit dan unik, `email` unik, `nomor_sim` unik. Status sukses: **201 Created**."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('pelangganId', pm.response.json().data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Perbarui pelanggan",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
